  `monitor/provenance.json` (written at setup: `runner` = this repo's commit/branch/dirty flag; `modules.<name>` = repo_dir,
  configured_branch, github_user, local_source, image_tag, def_file, sif path/size/mtime, git_commit/branch/remote/dirty).
- Open outputs in Python: `netCDF4.Dataset(path)`; discharge variables per module are listed in section 6
